0..79 Comment "// A recursive call nested in the constructor an arm returns: `S(S(dbl[<](x)))`"
80..154 Comment "// is sugar for running the call, then returning the constructors over its"
155..228 Comment "// value. Each fold respects the integers\' rules, so it is defined on the"
229..298 Comment "// quotient (Altenkirch et al., _Quotient inductive-inductive types_,"
299..336 Comment "// doi:10.1007/978-3-319-89366-2_16)."
